WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.876 --> 00:00:03.128
I've decided to tell you my life story.

00:00:03.212 --> 00:00:05.756
It all starts in Acapulco.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:08.926
The show "Acapulco"
is a rags-to-riches story

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:11.929
about this kid in the streets of Acapulco

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:15.098
and how he got to be this billionaire.

00:00:15.182 --> 00:00:18.435
Right now, I'm a pool boy.
But one day, I'm gonna own this place.

00:00:18.519 --> 00:00:20.020
Wow, I love the confidence.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:21.980
I felt that we needed a show

00:00:22.064 --> 00:00:24.691
you can watch and go to sleep
with a smile on your face,

00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:26.485
or solely for the soul.

00:00:26.568 --> 00:00:27.611
That's "Acapulco."

00:00:32.491 --> 00:00:35.702
During this second season,
all the characters are evolving.

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:40.290
Now that the characters are established,

00:00:40.374 --> 00:00:43.210
we can really dive into
what those relationships are like.

00:00:43.293 --> 00:00:45.879
And it expands the world we've set up.

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:50.509
We have a new love interest on the show.

00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:52.511
Isabel. She has no idea

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:55.848
about the connection I had
with Maximo in Season 1.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:05.816
Now that he's going back to his origins,
we're gonna see a different Maximo.

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:08.026
Back then he was another person.

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:10.571
He left, also, a lot of things pending.

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:12.531
Maximo.

00:01:12.614 --> 00:01:15.117
Okay, that's the second time
I see you hiding from me today.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.410
That's not what I was doing.

00:01:18.579 --> 00:01:21.915
Season 2 has been
even more fun than Season 1

00:01:21.999 --> 00:01:23.625
because we all know each other now.

00:01:23.709 --> 00:01:27.462
We are more free to try new tones.

00:01:27.546 --> 00:01:31.008
We play more with the rhythm
and pace of the scenes.

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:34.219
In thirty-six years
as a professional actress,

00:01:34.303 --> 00:01:37.639
it is not common to find
this sensation that we have.

00:01:37.723 --> 00:01:41.059
I like to believe that Las Colinas
is not a place or a destination.

00:01:41.143 --> 00:01:41.894
It's a community.

00:01:41.977 --> 00:01:45.355
The fact that we're shooting
here in Mexico, it's important to me.

00:01:45.439 --> 00:01:48.358
I want the series to reflect
how beautiful it is,

00:01:48.442 --> 00:01:50.110
and especially the people.

